{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1068276-2e-btp-horrors-as-goetia","id":1068276,"title":"[2E] BtP Horrors as Goetia","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-26T06:42:10-07:00","id":1068276,"title":"[2E] BtP Horrors as Goetia","content":"I want to run Astral story with some Anima Mundi 'Titans'. I think that closest to them would be <b>Beast: The Primordial</b> Horrors for this. <b>Question is how to reflect Horrors in Goetia stats?</b> <b>Beast</b>'s corebook does not seems to solve this conundrum. <b>What would be typical Rank level of Horrors in Goetia mechanics?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T08:42:49-07:00","id":1068309,"title":"","content":"Like all Goetia, different Horrors will have different stats. Small fears will have very different stats from universal nightmares.<br /> <br /> My recommendation would be to stat them like a normal Goetia. Rank 3 is sufficient to be intimidating. Give them Numina and Dread Powers modeled off Nightmares and Atavisms respectively. Most importantly of all, though, use the best part of Beast: Lairs. Let them control the Astral environment and prevent the players from entirely escaping them.<br /> <br /> If you wander into the Lair of some nebulous Horror, you can't escape. The ocean you try to sail from is endless; the empty plain that soaring shadow swoops over has no border. Throw Tilts at your players until they feel weak and afraid and the battlefield becomes the province of the Horror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}